{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/671","tmdb_id":671,"title":"哈利·波特与魔法石","original_title":"Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone","overview":"哈利·波特是一个孤儿，从小寄养在姨妈家，受尽欺凌。但就在哈利11岁生日的时候，他意外收到了霍格沃茨学院的入学通知书。哈利从该学院派来接他的巨人海格口中得知，这是一间魔法学院，并得知了自己的身世，原来哈利的父母都是伟大的魔法师，在对付伏地魔的战斗中双双献身，唯有哈利幸免于难。哈利进入霍格沃茨后，表现出了超乎想象的飞行天赋，得到麦格教授的推荐进入了格兰芬多的魁地奇球队。另一方面，哈利发现霍格沃茨学院内有一股黑暗势力似乎在暗暗滋长，揭开谜团的关键就在有凶恶的三头犬守护的房间内。哈利、罗恩和赫敏三个好朋友决定探个究竟。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oglmTTSAZb9FSO3IFuMK8F7qQ3.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XAC6RPT01UX9EQGy2JVn5c8pgy.jpg","release_date":"2001-11-16","year":"2001","runtime":"152 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.899,"tmdb_votes":29556,"tmdb_rating":"7.899 / 10 from 29556 users","genres":["冒险","奇幻"],"languages":["English"],"countries":["United Kingdom","United States of America"],"production_companies":["Warner Bros. Pictures","Heyday Films","1492 Pictures"],"directors":[{"name":"克里斯·哥伦布","id":10965}],"producers":[{"name":"大卫·海曼","id":10968}],"cast":[{"id":10980,"name":"丹尼尔·雷德克里夫","original_name":"Daniel Radcliffe","character":"Harry Potter","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/e64VeB4Mybwm2tOhyLY1h7XQQ8N.jpg"},{"id":10989,"name":"鲁伯特·格林特","original_name":"Rupert Grint","character":"Ron Weasley","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/q2KZZ0ltTEl7Sf8volNFV1JDEP4.jpg"},{"id":10990,"name":"艾玛·沃森","original_name":"Emma Watson","character":"Hermione Granger","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/A14lLCZYDhfYdBa0fFRpwMDiwRN.jpg"},{"id":194,"name":"理查德·哈里斯","original_name":"Richard Harris","character":"Albus Dumbledore","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/lCvcVMuxrg1f5A8OMqY9AqkkcZR.jpg"},{"id":10993,"name":"汤姆·费尔顿","original_name":"Tom Felton","character":"Draco Malfoy","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/etmtUBzJ1i1XJTLS6MkotJFE1se.jpg"},{"id":4566,"name":"艾伦·瑞克曼","original_name":"Alan Rickman","character":"Se